prompt autonomous lap -- the baton, the card, and the air rota
rota lap 4451, row 1 -- Air, the row that feels; its threshold asks a lap to press each reflex against the witness that checks it, and the press found a claim standing on care rather than construction
think Opened with the scoped cold roster pass detached, then read the air threshold page. Its cardinal seat is context/TAME_CORE.md, and its instruction is literal -- a reflex that has drifted from its witness is a fence post firm to the eye and loose to the hand.
think Pressed the nine tools TAME Core names in its checkable-surface table: nine present on disk, nine carrying a path row in construction/standing-equipment.kyri, nine declared clocks matching the roster's own tier. The claim beside the table is true today.
think Then asked what holds it. The roster's own note on the 20260908.111848 repair names the missing instrument in its own words -- an aggregate ratchet answers how many runners no lap reaches, and cannot answer whether the tool a law page declares as its checkable surface is one of them. That repair was made by hand and nothing held it.
think Built tame_core_surface as three walls at zero: declared tools present, rostered, and clock-agreeing. A tier absent reads lap, which is the roster's own rule rather than a convenience, so a block declining to write the common case is read as the common case.
think The control builds throwaway pens, each its own tree root so the scan's upward walk stops inside it. Every plant is counted while it stands and read back to zero once lifted, since a refusal proven only in the passing direction cannot be told from a bypass.
obs Two readings needed naming for a green to mean anything. An empty table refuses with surface_empty rather than passing, because a claim naming nothing proves nothing. An absent page or roster refuses by name rather than reading zero.
obs A table elsewhere on the page is not the checkable surface, so the section heading bounds the reading; a commented-out roster row rosters nothing; a trailing note on a tier line is a note.
obs Against myself: the card says hold still while the cold pass runs, and I edited the tree under it, so its close digest refuses tree_moved. The hot pass after git add is the green that measures what ships.
obs The hot pass over the staged tree reads 208 green, 3 red, 2 custody gates, tree held still, with tame_core_surface green. Three cold reds. remember_git_nib was mine -- the card's nib named 98ee0e0f91 where HEAD's parent stood at 86cb4b9107, the %450 shape, carried forward in this commit. sow_allow_reach refuses on an absent seed/.sow-projection.log, which is custody gate %1 rather than a tree red. stash_record reads 9 stashes, 6 records, 1 unlanded and 5 orphans -- the fleet's own recovery arc rather than this seat's. remember_git_nib reads green on the hot pass, so the carry-forward closed it.
